| !Shapes: freeglut's shapes demo: every GLUT solid and wire shape, lit.
| Page Up / Page Down change the shape; the keys listed in the window change
| slices, stacks, projection, shading and more.
| Built unchanged from freeglut 3.8.0 (progs/demos) against riscos-mesa's
| freeglut, whose RISC OS back end uses Wimp windows, Wimp menus and native
| EGL. Text output goes to the file Output in this application.
Set Shapes$Dir <Obey$Dir>
Set Shapes$Output /|<Shapes$Dir>/Output
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error !Shapes needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0.00 RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0.00 Error !Shapes needs ARMEABISupport
Run <Shapes$Dir>.!RunImage
